# requirement lines: ID | text   (the service under test is the simulated one in reqcheck.cpp)
R0 | the get API must be fast
R1 | mean latency of get <= 5 ms
R2 | p99 latency of get <= 20 ms at 400 req/s, open-loop, measured at gateway, over 10 min
R3 | p99 latency of get <= 20 ms at 250 req/s, open-loop, measured at gateway, over 10 min
R4 | p99.9 latency of get <= 40 ms at 250 req/s, open-loop, measured at gateway, over 10 min
